		{
			description: [
				"&l&8[&6PROJECT-MANAGER&8]"
				""
				"&6Welcome,&r Inmate."
				""
				"You have been sent to this planet as &cpunishment&r for your &4crimes.&r You are lucky though, it seems by sharing the names of your &cco-conspirators&r you have been assigned given a few, shall we say, perks. For starters, your planet has &alife&r and is rich with resources. The same cannot be said for &csome...&r"
				""
				"Your only hope to return to your &6home&r is to complete &l&6THE PROJECT&r. Think of it as your way of paying humanity for the &ccrimes&r you commited. Oh, you don't remember what you did? Well... you'll remember with time I suppose."
				""
				"Check this button to offically begin your sentence."
			]
			icon: "chipped:victorian_iron_bars_pikes"
			id: "25289F9E8AE01C29"
