				""
				"Well, &cbad&r news. You'll need to make a coke oven first. For now, grab some &6logs&r and we'll help you out."
				""
				"It is important to take note that &l&6many&r&r items have diffrent recipes. The first one shown is not &aalways&r the best. Take your time and explore recipes as you progress, you may find much cheaper &aalternatives&r as time goes on."
				""
				"PS: You're gonna need ALOT of wood. Get to chopping!"
