		{
			dependencies: ["0C690272ED4FB1C3"]
			description: [
				"&l&8[&6PROJECT-MANAGER&8]&r&r"
				"If you happen to spot &arocks&r along the surface as you travel, they are showing you what kind of &6vein&r can be found below. Right clicking will add it to your &amap.&r "
				""
				"If you gather enough tiny piles to make a full dust, hitting '&dr&r' on the dust will bring up many pages. From there navigate to the &bOre Processing Diagram&r. From there clicking on the raw ore will being up all veins which contain this &6ore.&r Each vein will show what ores it contains, the generation pattern, &bdimensions&r they can spawn in, the y levels, and the &aspawning weight&r(how common it is). "
			]
